
# Flex Accounts M-Pesa Backend

This backend receives Safaricom M-Pesa STK Push callbacks.

## Render deployment

Build command:
npm install

Start command:
npm start

## Callback URL

https://YOUR-RENDER-URL.onrender.com/api/mpesa/callback

## Health check

Open your Render URL in a browser.

You should see:
Flex Accounts M-Pesa callback backend is running.
